          {
            "text": "Each inspected Deci config\u2014DeciCoder-6B, DeciLM-6b, DeciLM-6b-instruct, DeciLM-7B, DeciLM-7B-instruct and DeciLM-7B-instruct-GGUF\u2014declares DeciLMForCausalLM. The same identifier appears in nvidia/Llama-3_1-Nemotron-51B-Instruct, nvidia/Llama-3_1-Nemotron-Ultra-253B-CPT-v1, nvidia/Llama-3_1-Nemotron-Ultra-253B-v1 and nvidia/Llama-3_3-Nemotron-Super-49B-v1. All match the retained registry key; matching that key alone does not establish construction or loading compatibility.",
